# emeye scheduled collection.
#
# cron's environment is famously empty, so EMEYE_* is exported by the
# entrypoint before crond starts, and output goes to /proc/1/fd/1 so
# `docker compose logs scheduler` shows it — rather than cron's mail spool,
# where nobody will ever look.
#
# Times are UTC. Add jobs one per line as phases deliver them.
#
# Phase 3 adds the real entries, e.g. shortly after the Beatport chart reset:
#   15 2 * * *  emeye ingest run beatport.top100 > /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
#   25 2 * * *  emeye ingest run beatport.hype100 > /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
#
# Nothing is scheduled yet: phase 2 ships the mechanism, phase 3 the jobs.

